sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant UI as React console (Register)
  participant API as FastAPI enrol routes
  participant Jobs as JobRunner
  participant Media as Media processing
  participant Br as Face, gait and appearance branches
  participant Repo as WatchlistRepository
  participant DB as Database
  Op->>UI: Choose photos or video, name and notes
  opt Check coverage
    UI->>API: POST /api/enroll/preview
    API->>Media: Detect and track people in the files
    Media-->>API: Signals the files can support
    API-->>UI: Coverage report
  end
  Op->>UI: Press Register
  UI->>API: POST /api/enroll
  API->>Jobs: Submit enrol job
  API-->>UI: Job id
  Jobs->>Media: observations_from_uploads(files)
  Media-->>Jobs: Tracked observations
  Jobs->>Br: embed_reference for each signal
  Br-->>Jobs: Templates, or the reason a signal was refused
  Jobs->>Repo: enroll(person, templates)
  Repo->>Repo: Encrypt templates
  Repo->>DB: Save person, templates and audit event
  loop Until the job finishes
    UI->>API: GET /api/jobs/job-id
    API-->>UI: Progress or result
  end
  UI-->>Op: Stored signals, and skipped signals with reasons
